## Suggested reading paths

* **The full course (recommended):** Pass 1 (P1.1 → P1.5), then Pass 2 in order A → I. Part J is optional.
* **Hardware and engineering focus:** P1.1, P1.2 → A1, A2 → B1–B6 → C2 → E1, E2 → G2 → H3 → I2.
* **Math and signal-processing focus:** P1.1, P1.3 → A2 → C2 → E1, E2 → F1–F3 → G1, G2 → I1 → H3 → J1, J5.
* **"How do I read a clinical image?" focus:** P1.1, P1.4, P1.5 → D1–D4 → H2 → I2.

